 To save up on opening a lot of files for reading , all names of a single device, including names of the devices' relays, are saved in a signle separate file.
 Devices are saved in devices/devices
 Name of the file should simply be the last 6 symbols of devices' MAC (in mosquitto tasmota/discovery/#/config.json it is the parameter t)
An example of how file is such a device name list is configured :

//Note - Relay 1 is the default relay and can be called upon with commands like POWER and POWER1 ! It is the default

Name of file : *t*
Contents of the file :

DEVICE *t*
DEVICE_NAME 

#RELAY_1:
relay_name_1
relay_name_2
...
relay_name_8

#RELAY_2:
relay_name_1
relay_name_2
...
relay_name_8

............

#RELAY_8:
relay_name_1
relay_name_2
...
relay_name_8